4). Write down the steps (as an algorithm, using simple numbered instructions) for ordering food on Swiggy — from opening the app to completing payment.
->>
1. Open the Swiggy app.
2. Log in or create an account.
3. Enter or confirm your delivery address.
4. Search for a restaurant or choose one from the list.
5. Select the food items you want to order.
6. Add the selected items to the cart.
7. Review the items, quantity, and total price.
8. Proceed to checkout.
9. Confirm the delivery address and order details.
10. Select a payment method.
11. Make the payment.
12. Wait for the payment to be completed successfully.
13. Receive the order confirmation.
